      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        102.29462432861328,
        527.4432983398438,
        116.73762512207031
      ],
      "text": "To make full use of available data for comparing the performance of these algorithms in different",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
