      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        152.3007354736328,
        527.387451171875,
        169.53773498535156
      ],
      "text": "(26, 33–47) included in this analysis  . Studies from 13 countries (including 12 high TB, TB/HIV and/or",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
