        70.86609649658203,
        168.29469299316406,
        524.3765258789062,
        182.73768615722656
      ],
      "text": "MDR-TB burden countries) within 5 of the 6 WHO regions were included. The cohort in the meta-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        181.4947052001953,
        527.4024047851562,
        195.9376983642578
      ],
      "text": "analysis used to inform this recommendation had a median age of 26 months (interquartile range",
