      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        194.69471740722656,
        527.435546875,
        209.13771057128906
      ],
      "text": "13.4–58.3); 38% of the children had TB, of which 30% was bacteriologically confirmed; 20% of the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        207.8946075439453,
        339.0231018066406,
        222.3376007080078
      ],
