      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        229.59864807128906,
        527.3948364257812,
        244.04164123535156
      ],
      "text": "Seven algorithms or scoring systems were identified for evaluation, comprising the Uganda National",
