        70.86609649658203,
        253.20472717285156,
        527.4224243164062,
        270.4417419433594
      ],
      "text": "(49) (50) (51) System  , the Gunasekera et al. 2021 algorithm  , the Keith Edward score  , the Marcy et al.",
