      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        343.7025146484375,
        527.4345092773438,
        358.1455383300781
      ],
      "text": "For the overall population of children under the age of 10 years, the pooled sensitivity of the seven",
