      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        356.9026184082031,
        527.189208984375,
        371.34564208984375
      ],
      "text": "algorithms or scoring systems ranged from 16% (Marais et al. criteria) to 95% (Gunasekera et al.",
