      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        370.10260009765625,
        527.1426391601562,
        384.5456237792969
      ],
      "text": "algorithm), while the pooled specificity ranged from 9% (Gunasekera et al. algorithm) to 89% (Marais",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.996099472045898,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        383.3025207519531,
        154.36720275878906,
        397.74554443359375
      ],
      "text": "et al. criteria) (see",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
