      "bbox": [
        154.37060546875,
        383.3025207519531,
        212.6156005859375,
        397.74554443359375
      ],
      "text": "web annex 3",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        212.6147003173828,
        383.3025207519531,
        221.17271423339844,
        397.74554443359375
      ],
      "text": ").",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        404.83050537109375,
        527.390625,
        419.44952392578125
      ],
      "text": "GDG considerations:  The GDG felt that algorithms with clinical criteria have an important role to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        418.2065124511719,
        527.4069213867188,
        432.6495361328125
      ],
      "text": "play in making decisions on starting children on TB treatment, particularly at peripheral levels of the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        431.406494140625,
        527.5654907226562,
        445.8495178222656
      ],
      "text": "health care system. There was strong consensus among the GDG members about the need and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        444.60650634765625,
        527.6309204101562,
        459.0495300292969
      ],
      "text": "importance of working on treatment decision algorithms to improve the gaps in TB case detection in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.998749732971191,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        457.8065185546875,
        527.484130859375,
        472.2495422363281
      ],
      "text": "children. An important advantage of evidence-based algorithms (as it allocates a modelled weight to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.992947578430176,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        471.0065002441406,
        527.4422607421875,
        485.44952392578125
      ],
      "text": "features of clinical evaluation), is that this modelling process allows for specification of the weight of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        484.2065124511719,
        527.501220703125,
        498.6495361328125
      ],
      "text": "certain clinical features, rather than being based solely on expert opinion. The panel highlighted that",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.99940013885498,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        497.406494140625,
        527.4476928710938,
        511.8495178222656
      ],
      "text": "data in the IPD were mainly from tertiary settings where the proportion of children with confirmed",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        510.60650634765625,
        527.3804931640625,
        525.0494995117188
      ],
      "text": "TB is higher than at district hospital or PHC level. It was acknowledged that the IPD had a high level",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        523.8065185546875,
        527.3772583007812,
        538.24951171875
      ],
      "text": "of heterogeneity. Conducting a meta-regression analysis by level of the health care system was not",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        537.0064697265625,
        303.38861083984375,
        551.449462890625
      ],
      "text": "possible because of the limited number of studies.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        558.71044921875,
        527.3992919921875,
        573.1534423828125
      ],
      "text": "The GDG concluded that none of the evaluated algorithms were optimal in terms of either sensitivity",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        571.9105224609375,
        527.4310302734375,
        586.353515625
      ],
      "text": "or specificity, combined with the very low certainty of evidence. The GDG also noted that algorithms",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        585.1104125976562,
        527.4290161132812,
        599.5534057617188
      ],
      "text": "with a high sensitivity (i.e. low number of false negatives) generally have a low specificity (i.e. a high",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        598.3104248046875,
        527.410400390625,
        612.75341796875
      ],
      "text": "number of false positives) and vice versa. The panel reflected on the consequences of false negative",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        611.5103759765625,
        527.4158325195312,
        625.953369140625
      ],
      "text": "and false positive conclusions based on integrated treatment decision algorithms and agreed that",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        624.7103881835938,
        527.3905029296875,
        639.1533813476562
      ],
      "text": "it was most important to avoid missing a TB diagnosis in a child who has TB, considering the large",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        637.9105224609375,
        396.78857421875,
        652.353515625
      ],
      "text": "case detection gap and the consequences of a missed diagnosis of TB.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        659.6143798828125,
        527.436767578125,
        674.057373046875
      ],
      "text": "During the GDG deliberations, the following options that emerged from the evidence review were",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        672.8143920898438,
        527.5829467773438,
        687.2573852539062
      ],
      "text": "discussed: (i) choose one of the algorithms reviewed for a possible recommendation; (ii) make a",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        686.0142822265625,
        527.4025268554688,
        700.457275390625
      ],
      "text": "generic recommendation on the use of integrated treatment decisions algorithms and present new",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        699.2142944335938,
        527.4091796875,
        713.6572875976562
      ],
      "text": "evidence-based algorithms in the operational handbook; (iii) make a statement about the need for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        712.4144287109375,
        484.9239501953125,
        726.857421875
      ],
      "text": "further research on treatment decision algorithms, affirming the need for such algorithms.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        734.1182861328125,
        527.1087036132812,
        748.561279296875
      ],
      "text": "The GDG judged the available evidence as inappropriate to support a recommendation for any specific",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.949182510375977,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        747.3182983398438,
        527.5842895507812,
        761.7612915039062
      ],
      "text": "algorithm; and instead decided to make a generic recommendation on the use of treatment decision",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.992447853088379,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
